Process-metric self-test case: preflight-d-sibling-read

Kind: preflight (score/preflight.ts), arm D, task T1

Scenario
One assistant message (started at t=0) holds a Read of src/payments/service.ts and the first src Edit (tool_use at t=3). The Read loads the payments rule at t=1, after the message began but before the Edit's tool_use.

Expected
The rule reached the model only after the message that wrote the Edit: d_delivered false and D_RULE_NOT_LOADED.

@RUN@ in stream.jsonl and instr.jsonl stands for the recorded run root; ../process.ts substitutes it.
